  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lStats:§r\n+20% Size\n+20% Melee Damage\n-10% Movement Speed\n \n§e§lFeatures:§r\n- Your wings allow natural elytra-style flight. Equipping an Elytra bypasses your normal flight restrictions.\n- Hitting a creature while falling or flying ignites it for 10 seconds.\n- You cannot use Firework Rockets or Wind Charges for propulsion.\n- §e§lGusts of Freedom§r cannot be used while §c§l[Wet]§r.\n- While Wet, you lose your melee damage bonus and suffer -20% movement speed. Contact with water extends this penalty by 1 second per second, up to 2 minutes.\n- You are a Carnivore.",
